{"kind":"request","text":"R4 item1: decide durable Site token reuse and interrupted-mint semantics.","body":{"conditions":"Choose the R4 item1 interrupted-mint policy before implementation. Proposed literal one-live-token-per-repository/ref design uses existing fixed ScopeIndex private durable ready-token/reservation custody; known tokens survive eviction, unknown mint reservations fail closed until an explicit operator/provider resolution. No memory-only relaxation is assumed.","proposal":"Existing Site host currently calls Artifacts createToken(read,120) and revokes on every close; the API has no idempotency key/token lookup/list. Actual expiresAt, not requestedTTL, is authoritative. Proposed acquire RPC is binding-only under installed code authority. Key includes current validated config identity, complete repository tuple and canonical published native ref. Fresh config/remote/publication checks remain on every read; only credential is shared, never proof or Git objects. One durable reserved row before first provider await; one in-memory single-flight with bounded waiters, then private ready row with \u003c=4096-byte plaintext and actual canonical future expiry. Proposed caps256keys,32mints,8waiters/key64total. No live eviction/remint, no remint on ambiguous401/network failure, no expiry extension; full/unknown returns503. close releases request-local reader only; provider expiry ends credential and bounded maintenance erases it. Known-expired ready row permits one fresh mint. Unknown interrupted mint cannot safely infer end from120-second request, so key remains unavailable until separately authorized resolution. No new public route/binding/setting is inherently needed.","question":"Do you accept strict durable custody with fail-closed unknown reservations for the parent literal reuse requirement, or supply provider idempotency/lookup or a specific accepted unknown-outcome exception? Memory-only caching across owner lifetime would allow another live token after eviction and is not selected.","target":"inherit","to":"20db43a245e9780b92a587425d387d393b17ffc90b89e036ff752399f88fc517"}}